Significance: minor
Type: changed

Tooltips: Draw every chart tooltip on one light surface that matches the WordPress design system popover, with a border, a medium shadow and medium padding, and add the `--a8c-charts-color-surface-stroke` and `--a8c-charts-elevation-md` roles. The below-axis line chart tooltip no longer draws a pointer. For a dark tooltip, repoint `--a8c-charts-color-surface` and `--a8c-charts-color-label` in `tooltipStyle`: LineChart no longer adds a dark background when `tooltipStyle` sets only `color`. A custom `renderGlyph` can now receive a `var()` color instead of a hex when the series has no palette color.
